      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "As shown by conjunctival biomicroscopy, microcirculatory picture in 176 patients with coronary heart disease (CHD) compared to that of 76 healthy controls exhibited gross changes in the terminal vascular bed. 36 CHD patients have received laser treatment. Positive trends correlating with clinical response were registered in these laser-treated patients."},
